"Add to VoiceBrief" = "Tambahkan ke VoiceBrief";
"Securely copying the voice note…" = "Menyalin pesan suara dengan aman…";
"Your brief is ready" = "Ringkasan Anda siap";
"%d date item(s) found. Tap to review the brief and add dates." = "%d tanggal ditemukan. Ketuk untuk meninjau ringkasan dan menambahkan tanggal.";
"Processing is complete. Tap to view the brief." = "Pemrosesan selesai. Ketuk untuk melihat ringkasan.";
"Preparing your brief" = "Menyiapkan ringkasan Anda";
"Your brief is being prepared. You can close this window now; we'll notify you when it's ready." = "Ringkasan sedang disiapkan. Anda boleh menutup jendela ini; kami akan memberi tahu saat siap.";
"The result was saved, but VoiceBrief notifications are disabled. Enable them in iPhone Settings so the ready alert can open the brief directly." = "Hasil tersimpan, tetapi notifikasi VoiceBrief dinonaktifkan. Aktifkan di Pengaturan iPhone agar notifikasi dapat membuka ringkasan langsung.";
"Done" = "Selesai";
"Voice note saved" = "Pesan suara disimpan";
"Open VoiceBrief once after updating to prepare your account for sharing, then share the voice note again." = "Buka VoiceBrief sekali setelah pembaruan untuk menyiapkan akun, lalu bagikan pesan suara lagi.";
"The file was saved, but its duration could not be read for in-share processing." = "File disimpan, tetapi durasinya tidak dapat dibaca untuk diproses di sini.";
"The voice note was saved, but an internet connection is required to finish the brief." = "Pesan disimpan, tetapi internet diperlukan untuk menyelesaikan ringkasan.";
"The voice note was saved, but your available minutes are not enough to process it." = "Pesan disimpan, tetapi sisa menit Anda tidak cukup untuk memprosesnya.";
"The voice note was saved, but processing is unavailable right now. Try sharing again shortly." = "Pesan disimpan, tetapi pemrosesan belum tersedia. Coba bagikan lagi sebentar lagi.";
"Import failed" = "Impor gagal";
"Close" = "Tutup";
"WhatsApp did not provide a readable audio file. Select only the voice note and share again." = "WhatsApp tidak memberikan audio yang dapat dibaca. Pilih hanya pesan suara dan bagikan lagi.";
"This audio file could not be read. Download the voice note in WhatsApp, then share it again." = "Audio tidak dapat dibaca. Unduh pesan di WhatsApp, lalu bagikan lagi.";
"The voice note must be smaller than 25 MB." = "Ukuran pesan suara harus kurang dari 25 MB.";
"This build cannot access shared storage. The app and Share Extension must be signed with App Groups." = "Versi ini tidak dapat mengakses penyimpanan bersama. Aplikasi dan ekstensi harus ditandatangani dengan App Groups.";
"The voice note could not be saved for the app. Open VoiceBrief once, then try again." = "Pesan tidak dapat disimpan untuk aplikasi. Buka VoiceBrief sekali, lalu coba lagi.";
